<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;600&amp;family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 850px;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            line-height: 1.35;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 3px double #000;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .section {
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .section h2 {
            font-size: 16px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        p, li {
            margin: 6px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .indent {
            text-indent: 30px;
        }
        .noindent {
            text-indent: 0;
        }
        .signature {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 40px 0 0 0;
        }
        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 220px;
            background: #f8f8f8;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            margin: 20px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="title">SAMPLE DOCUMENT TITLE</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Subtitle or Section Header</div>
    </div>

    <p class="noindent"><strong>Sample Paragraph:</strong> This is the first paragraph of the document. It demonstrates the basic structure and how text flows across the page with standard justification and spacing.</p>

    <p class="indent">The second paragraph continues the content, showing proper indentation for the body text. In the original layout, this block would be aligned consistently with the first paragraph.</p>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Section Title</h2>
        <p>This section contains subheadings and related text. The layout mirrors typical document formatting with headings separated from body paragraphs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="placeholder" style="width: 380px; height: 180px; margin: 30px auto;">
        [Chart: centered diagram occupying the middle of the page]
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Another Section</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>First list item in the document layout.</li>
            <li>Second list item, continuing the vertical flow.</li>
            <li>Third item with proper bullet spacing.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="signature">
        Signature Line<br>
        ______________________________<br>
        John Doe, Date
    </div>

    <div class="placeholder" style="width: 250px; height: 120px; float: right; margin: 10px; clear: both;">
        [Figure: side-placed image]
    </div>
</body>
</html>
